    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cc2e0500-57b1-4615-82cb-1c950e5f2ec4",
              "name": "json_master",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={\n  \"reference_images\": {\n  \"front\": \"The authoritative front view reference.\",\n  \"back\": \"The authoritative back view reference.\",\n  \"body_shape\": \"Body shape or garment fit reference.\"\n},\n  \"description\": \"Brief description of the garment showcase and intended product presentation.\",\n  \"style\": \"photorealistic | commercial product photography | studio | catalog\",\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"type\": \"Ghost mannequin apparel\",\n    \"garment\": \"Garment type (or automatically detect from the reference images).\",\n    \"fit\": \"Garment fit or body shape.\",\n    \"preserve\": \"Visible garment details to preserve, including construction, silhouette, seams, stitching, collar, sleeves, fabric, texture, colors, graphics, typography, labels, and print placement.\"\n  },\n\n  \"reconstruction\": {\n  \"reference\": \"Use the front and back reference images as the absolute source of truth. The front reference represents the front view, and the back reference represents the back view of the same garment.\",\n  \"method\": \"Reconstruct one physically consistent 3D garment by accurately merging both reference images. Generate all intermediate views naturally between the defined front, back, left ,right orientations while preserving geometry, proportions, fabric, seams, and artwork.\",\n  \"consistency\": \"The front artwork must remain on the front surface only, and the back artwork must remain on the back surface only. Maintain correct spatial placement and continuity from every viewing angle throughout the entire rotation.\"\n},\n\n\"camera\": {\n  \"type\": \"Describe a fixed studio camera.\",\n  \"framing\": \"Describe how the garment should remain centered and fully visible.\"\n},\n  \"composition\": {\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"3:4\",\n    \"subject_size\": \"Desired percentage of frame occupied by the garment.\",\n    \"alignment\": \"Describe subject positioning within the frame.\",\n    \"padding\": \"Describe required empty space around the garment.\",\n    \"cropping\": \"Describe cropping restrictions.\"\n  },\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"type\": \"soft studio\",\n    \"setup\": \"Describe the lighting setup.\",\n    \"consistency\": \"Describe how lighting should remain consistent throughout the animation.\"\n  },\n  \"background\": {\n    \"type\": \"Solid seamless studio background.\",\n    \"color\": \"Background color.\",\n    \"consistency\": \"Describe how the background should remain unchanged throughout the animation.\"\n  },\n  \"animation\": {\n    \"duration\":\"5 seconds\"\n    \"speed\": \"Fast, constant, and uniform throughout the entire video.\",\n    \"rotation\": \"One complete 360° clockwise turntable rotation.\",\n    \"speed\": \"Fast, constant, and uniform throughout the entire video.\",\n    \"start_view\": \"Begin at the exact front reference orientation.\",\n\"end_view\": \"Finish at the exact same front reference orientation after one complete rotation.\",\n    \"motion\": \"Perform one continuous 360 rotation, uninterrupted clockwise turntable rotation.\"\n  },\n  \"rendering\": {\n    \"quality\": \"Photorealistic commercial product render.\",\n    \"fabric\": \"Preserve realistic fabric texture, folds, stitching, and printed artwork exactly as shown in the reference images.\",\n    \"sharpness\": \"High-resolution with crisp edges and clear print details.\",\n    \"temporal_consistency\": \"Maintain consistent geometry, colors, lighting, and artwork throughout the entire rotation with no flickering, warping, or distortion.\"\n  },\n  \"constraints\": [\n    \"List mandatory preservation rules.\",\n    \"List reconstruction rules.\",\n    \"List camera restrictions.\",\n    \"List framing restrictions.\",\n    \"List background consistency requirements.\"\n  ],\n  \"negative_constraints\": [\n    \"List objects or artifacts that must never appear.\",\n    \"Examples: mannequin, hanger, support, camera movement, motion blur, distortion, half rotation, flickering.\"\n  ],\n  \"output\": {\n    \"format\": \"3:4\",\n    \"quality\": \"HD | 4K\",\n    \"duration\": \"Video length in seconds.\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"ghost mannequin\",\n    \"360 full rotation\",\n    \"commercial apparel\",\n    \"product photography\",\n    \"photorealistic\",\n    \"studio lighting\",\n    \"garment showcase\"\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7dee299b-d546-4f8a-8153-cc0bab3dc94c",
      "name": "Set Master Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1680,
        -832
      ],
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a 360 video prompt using both the reference image.  \n\n**Reference Inputs**  \n \"front_image\": \"{{ $('Map Generated Images').item.json.front_image_description }}\",\n \"back_image\": \"{{ $('Map Generated Images').item.json.back_image_description }}\",\n \"body_shape\":\"{{ $('Map Generated Images').item.json.body_type }}\"\n\n**Rules**  \n- Keep the style casual, authentic, and realistic.\n- Default model: `seedance-2-mini` (unless otherwise specified).  \n- Output only **one JSON object** with the key: `video_prompt`.  \n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=** Role & Purpose **\nYou are a **Structured Video Ad Prompt Generator**.\n\nGenerate exactly one JSON object with this structure:\n\n{\n  \"title\": \"...\",\n  \"video_prompt\": \"...\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Output ONLY valid JSON. Do not include markdown, explanations, or any extra text.\n- The JSON must contain exactly two top-level keys:\n  - \"title\"\n  - \"video_prompt\"\n- Generate only one output.\n- \"title\" must be unique, descriptive, and no longer than 15 words.\n- Use `{{ $json.json_master }}` as the complete specification for the video prompt.\n- Treat the master JSON as the source of truth for all required instructions, including reconstruction, camera, composition, lighting, background, animation, rendering, constraints, and output requirements.\n- Do NOT reproduce, copy, or stringify the master JSON.\n- Instead, transform the information from the master JSON into one clear, natural-language prompt that an image-to-video model can directly understand.\n- Integrate all provided inputs and reference images naturally into the prompt.\n- Use the reference images as the visual source of truth for the garment, artwork, colors, proportions, and all visible details.\n- Preserve every important requirement from the master JSON, but remove repetition and unnecessary verbosity.\n- Combine related instructions into concise sentences instead of listing every field individually.\n- Do not mention JSON keys, field names, or the schema itself.\n- Write the entire `video_prompt` as a single paragraph with no line breaks.\n- Keep the `video_prompt` under 6,000 characters.\n\nReturn only the JSON object."
        }
      },
